$IBMAP CMPARE  18                                                               
*CMPARE       LOGICAL COMPARE FUNCTION FOR FORTRAN IV                           
       ENTRY  CMPARE                                                            
*                  CODE=    IF(CMPARE(ARG1,ARG2))N1,N2,N3                       
*                    CONTROL GOES TO N1 IF ARG1 LESS THAN ARG2,                 
*                                 TO N2 IF ARG1 EQUAL TO ARG2,                  
*                             AND TO N3 IF ARG1 GREATER THAN ARG2.              
*                                                                               
CMPARE CAL*   3,4                                                               
       LAS*   4,4                                                               
FLAG   TRA    PLUS                                                              
       TRA    ZRO                                                               
       CLS    FLAG                                                              
       TRA    1,4                                                               
ZRO    PXA    0,0                                                               
       TRA    1,4                                                               
PLUS   CLA    FLAG                                                              
       TRA    1,4                                                               
       END                                                                      
